# Lives at the repo root, not in src/iqc-site/, so that root-level files (README.md,
# lefthook.yml, CI workflows) resolve to the project's Prettier config. Prettier searches
# *upward* from each file: with the config inside src/iqc-site/, every file above it
# silently fell back to Prettier's defaults (80 cols, double quotes) instead of erroring.
#
# Patterns are relative to this file, i.e. the repo root. A pattern containing a slash is
# anchored here -- "src/assets" would mean promo-site/src/assets, which does not exist.
# Patterns without a slash match at any depth.

dist
dist-ssr
coverage
node_modules

# Per-developer local state, not repo style.
.claude/settings.local.json

src/iqc-site/public
src/iqc-site/src/assets

# npm rewrites these on every install; let it own their formatting rather than
# fighting the pre-commit hook over it.
package.json
package-lock.json
